Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 13:42:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 55/98] =?UTF-8?q?=F0=9F=94=92=20Prevent=20command=20inject?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ion=20in=20exvi=20via=20direct=20execution=20(#1270)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Replace popen/pclose with custom exvi_popen/exvi_pclose
- Implement exvi_tokenize_command to split arguments safely
- Use execvp instead of shell execution to bypass shell metacharacters
- Drop privileges (setgid/setuid) in child process before execution
- Consistently enforce secure_mode and restricted_mode
- Add test_secure_command_execution to verify the fix

Co-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: segin <480709+segin@users.noreply.github.com>
